  "body": "In a private room (1-to-1 conversation) I shared a picture and then copied the link to the uploaded picture file. I opened another browser and was able to view the image even though I wasn't signed in.\r\n\r\nSo it seems that there are no access rights for uploaded/shared files in place, which in my opinion is a (considerable) lack of security.\r\n\r\nWould be great if you could provide an internal API for accessing files that checks access permissions upon a request.",
